ly can be used to fulfill the requirement of this\n\n Minor Programme.</p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:45.1pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.0pt\"> </p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:415.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"555\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\"> </p> </td> </tr></table>"
